.Dd February 1, 2026
.Dt BUS_COMPATIBLE_MATCH 9
.Os Substrate
.Sh NAME
.Nm bus_compatible_match
.Nd match driver compatible string against device
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In sys/kern/bus.h
.Ft int
.Fn bus_compatible_match "const char *compat" "struct device *dev"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn bus_compatible_match
function checks if the
.Fa compat
string provided by a driver matches any of the compatible strings listed in the
.Fa dev
structure.
.Pp
The
.Va dev->compatible
field is expected to be a NUL-separated list of strings, terminated by an
empty string (double NUL).
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns 1 if the
.Fa compat
string is found in the device's compatible list, 0 otherwise.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr bus 9 ,
.Xr device 9
